  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.3.0 - Live words: AiStreamingSpeechEngine (Nemotron Speech Streaming 0.6B, words as they are spoken, 5.63% WER on 60 LibriSpeech clips, a 160 ms chunk in ~70 ms); on SpawnDev.ILGPU.ML 5.3.10 (fixes Sub/Min/Max of equal-size operands with different shapes). v1.2.0 - Speech: Parakeet TDT speech to text (AiSpeechEngine model family), speaker identification (AiSpeakerEngine, SpeakerRegistry: who is talking, introductions, guests), end-of-turn detection (AiTurnEngine, Smart Turn v3.2: has the speaker finished?). On SpawnDev.ILGPU.ML 5.3.9 (periodic-Hann Whisper mel, ConvInteger, fp16 external-data weights, ten library fixes). Full history: CHANGELOG.md",
